{
  "name": "INKAMBILLING - WA Ticket Bot (WAHA)",
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1",
    "saveDataSuccessExecution": "all",
    "saveDataErrorExecution": "all"
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "note-setup",
      "name": "Catatan Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Bot Tiket WhatsApp — INKAMBILLING\n\n**Setup (sekali saja):**\n1. Buka node **Config** → isi `inkambillingUrl`, `wahaUrl`, `wahaSession`, `webhookToken` (string acak, mis. `openssl rand -hex 24`).\n2. Credential **Header Auth** \"INKAMBILLING n8n Token\": Name `X-N8N-TOKEN`, Value = `N8N_API_TOKEN` di .env server.\n3. Credential **Header Auth** \"WAHA API Key\": Name `X-Api-Key`, Value = API key WAHA.\n4. **Activate** workflow → salin Production URL node **WAHA Webhook**, tambahkan `?token=<webhookToken>`.\n5. Isi URL itu ke `WAHA_EXTRA_WEBHOOK_URLS` di .env server INKAMBILLING lalu restart app (atau daftarkan manual di WAHA, event: `message`).\n\nPanduan lengkap: docs/WA-TICKET-BOT.md",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-flow",
      "name": "Catatan Alur",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        520,
        -260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Alur\nPesan WA → cek token & awalan `#` → backend `/api/n8n/wa/command` (cek nomor karyawan, eksekusi tiket) → balasan dikirim lewat WAHA.\n\nPesan biasa (tanpa `#`) berhenti di node **Valid?** — tidak ada yang tersimpan.\n\nJika server INKAMBILLING tidak merespons, pengirim tetap dapat balasan \"server sedang gangguan\".",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "wa-webhook",
      "name": "WAHA Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        200
      ],
      "webhookId": "6d0c8f7e-2b9a-4d51-9c3e-inkambilling-wa",
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "inkambilling/wa-ticket-bot",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "wa-config",
      "name": "Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {},
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "cfg-1",
              "name": "inkambillingUrl",
              "value": "http://192.168.100.10:3301",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "cfg-2",
              "name": "wahaUrl",
              "value": "http://192.168.100.10:3000",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "cfg-3",
              "name": "wahaSession",
              "value": "default",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "cfg-4",
              "name": "webhookToken",
              "value": "GANTI_DENGAN_TOKEN_ACAK",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "wa-valid",
      "name": "Valid?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "valid-1",
              "leftValue": "={{ String($('Config').item.json.webhookToken || '') !== '' && String($json.query?.token || '') === $('Config').item.json.webhookToken && $json.body?.event === 'message' && $json.body?.payload?.fromMe !== true && String($json.body?.payload?.body || '').trim().startsWith('#') }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "looseTypeValidation": true,
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "wa-command",
      "name": "INKAMBILLING Command",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        680,
        180
      ],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput",
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').item.json.inkambillingUrl.replace(/\\/+$/, '') }}/api/n8n/wa/command",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "X-Idempotency-Key",
              "value": "=wa.command:{{ $json.body.payload.id }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json.body) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "inkambilling-n8n-token",
          "name": "INKAMBILLING n8n Token"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "wa-split",
      "name": "Pisah Balasan",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        920,
        120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Backend membalas { replies: [{ chatId, text, reply_to }] } -> 1 item per pesan.\nconst out = [];\nfor (const item of $input.all()) {\n  for (const r of (item.json.replies || [])) {\n    if (r && r.chatId && r.text) out.push({ json: { chatId: r.chatId, text: r.text, reply_to: r.reply_to || null } });\n  }\n}\nreturn out;"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "wa-fallback",
      "name": "Balasan Gangguan",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        920,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Server INKAMBILLING tidak merespons / error -> tetap beri tahu pengirim.\nconst p = $('Config').first().json.body?.payload || {};\nif (!p.from) return [];\nreturn [{ json: { chatId: p.from, text: '⚠️ Server tiket sedang gangguan, perintah belum tersimpan. Coba lagi beberapa menit lagi atau input lewat web.', reply_to: p.id || null } }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "wa-send",
      "name": "Kirim via WAHA",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1160,
        200
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 2000,
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').first().json.wahaUrl.replace(/\\/+$/, '') }}/api/sendText",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify(Object.assign({ session: $('Config').first().json.wahaSession || 'default', chatId: $json.chatId, text: $json.text }, $json.reply_to ? { reply_to: $json.reply_to } : {})) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 20000,
          "batching": {
            "batch": {
              "batchSize": 1,
              "batchInterval": 800
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "waha-api-key",
          "name": "WAHA API Key"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "WAHA Webhook": {
      "main": [
